### Auth Service API Tests

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8081/health

### Register New User
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "name": "Ivan Ivanov"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}

### Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
}

### Get Current User (requires auth)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### Change Password (requires auth)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "SecurePass123",
  "new_password": "NewSecurePass456"
}

### Logout (requires auth)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
X-Refresh-Token: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### Logout from All Devices (requires auth)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
